  "title": "Joan of Arc",
  "summary": "Born around 1412 in Domrémy, Lorraine, Joan entered besieged Orléans in late April 1429; the English siege, begun in October 1428, was lifted on 8 May 1429. She was captured near Compiègne on 23 May 1430, tried by a Church court at Rouen and burned there on 30 May 1431. The pin marks Orléans.",
